+The plugin supports these options:
+
+	series: {
+		threshold: {
+			below: number
+			color: colorspec
+		}
+	}
+
+It can also be applied to a single series, like this:
+
+	$.plot( $("#placeholder"), [{
+		data: [ ... ],
+		threshold: { ... }
+	}])
